-- 0082 — The renewal portfolio's blocks, registered for Living surfaces (D-158).
--
-- A portfolio surface is selected by a typed query (window, grouping, filters, comparison) that a
-- person refines in plain language. QueryInterpretation says the active view back in words, and
-- what was not understood; PortfolioGroups shows the renewals it selects, with totals and premium
-- changes computed from records. Read-only to the application; living-registry.test.ts holds both
-- equal to their Zod source.

